## 3. Approval Failure Classification Correction

Phase 36 将所有 `run_tests → 【需要审批】BLOCKED` 归类为 `VERIFICATION_PROVIDER_FAILURE`，这是错误分类。

**纠正后的分类体系**：

| 分类 | 含义 |
|------|------|
| `APPROVAL_REQUESTED` | run_tests 被 Approval Gate 拦截，pending 已创建 |
| `APPROVAL_DECISION_PENDING` | 等待外部 actor 决策 |
| `APPROVAL_GRANTED` | 用户/ harness approve |
| `APPROVAL_DENIED` | 用户/ harness deny |
| `APPROVAL_RESUME_FAILED` | approve 后 resume 失败 |
| `APPROVAL_LIFECYCLE_PASS` | 完整 lifecycle 成功（request→grant→execute） |
| `PROVIDER_FAILURE` | 仅用于 model/provider timeout/connection/error |

