## 5. Approval State Lifecycle

```
RUNNING
  ↓ tool requests protected action (run_tests)
  ↓ ApprovalGate.check() → pending created in DB
WAITING_APPROVAL
  ↓
  ├── approved ──→ runner resumes same run_id
  │                  ↓ gate.check() finds approved in DB
  │                  ↓ tool executes with original args
  │                  ↓ runs until completion or next approval
  │
  ├── denied ────→ mark_failure("审批拒绝")
  │
  └── no decision ──→ remain WAITING_APPROVAL
                       (convergence/no-progress NOT triggered)
```

**关键**：`WAITING_APPROVAL` 是外部等待状态，convergence detector 不应将其视为 agent 无进展。

